    "Nansen was not connected. smartWalletCount and kolCount are null so the UI shows an em dash; never write 0 to mean missing.",
    "Ages on smartFlows are as last read during the scroll capture; the same wallet+action+token+usd row can show a drifted age on later passes, so ages are approximate. A Paused indicator appeared on the 1h Smart Inflow board after scrolling; it was not used as a reason to drop rows. Screenshots: trending.png and token-info-crop.png (Solana 1h Trending table ~8:14 PM ET), inflow-0-initial.png, inflow.png, inflow-2.png, inflow-3.png, inflow-4.png.",
    "Trending top 10 and Token Info percentages were taken from a signed-in GMGN Solana 1h Trending table at https://gmgn.ai/trend?chain=sol (Trending tab, 1h, confirmed selected in trending.png) at ~8:14 PM ET and checked against trending.png and token-info-crop.png. price was not shown on the table (stored null). Token Info icons: green-person % = insiderPct, stacked-layers % = top10Pct, diamond/crosshair % = sniperPct. Hook-like and clipboard/document chips, plus Tax / DS / Unpaid / $299 / CTO, were not mapped into those three fields.",
