    "Addresses for all 10 trending rows came from GMGN token-link hrefs in the same session, in screenshot order.",
    "smartFlows are 1h per-wallet Smart Inflow card rows from https://gmgn.ai/monitor?chain=sol&tab=smartdegen (Monitor > Smart, 1h), not the left-rail Smart Degen feed or Smart Net Inflow aggregates. usd is the signed 1h net inflow GMGN displayed; some Sell All/Sell Partial rows are still positive (and a few First Buy/Buy More rows negative) because that column is 1h net, not the last fill. Inflow screenshots cover the top screens of the board (initial plus later scrolls as inflow-2.png, inflow-3.png, inflow-4.png); lower cards were read from the board DOM over 12 scroll steps and are not in a screenshot. The board is live and virtualized, so later rows are a DOM-text union; a few wallets appear twice on the same token with different usd values and both readings were kept. Subscript inflow figures such as $-0.0₃67 were stored as -0.000067.",
    "walletFull (complete base58) was recorded only when GMGN exposed it (wallet link href, copy button, hover, or equivalent). Card rows often did not expose a full address in the card DOM; rows were given walletFull by matching the row's short wallet label to an exposed /sol/address/ href (6 unique labels in the left rail, of which 6 also appeared on the card grid; none of those 6 were ambiguous). Full addresses were not guessed from abbreviations. Some wallet labels are names rather than prefix…suffix abbreviations (for example Xav, Turzz, Steven.). tokenCaAbbrev is included to disambiguate reused tickers.",
